## Key Learnings

### 1. Data Is More Valuable When Visualized

Charts and dashboards make complex data easier to understand.

### 2. AI Can Generate Complete Applications

Claude can build production-style HTML dashboards directly from structured requirements.

### 3. Business Intelligence Requires Context

Raw numbers become meaningful only when connected to real-world decision making.

### 4. Prompt Quality Determines Output Quality

Well-structured prompts lead to significantly better dashboards and insights.

